      </div>

      <div class="project-block">
        <h3>Predator avoidance</h3>
        <p>[Liu et al. 2021; Eifler &amp; Eifler 2014; Jacobson et al. 2016; Eifler et al. 2025; Utsumi et al. 2026]</p>
